y regarding the user's request. I wonder if inspecting the workspace might help identify related skills. Should I ask if they want to know the actual implementation status? I think I can still provide an answer based on the current workspace info. Scanning the files for terms like \\\"multi-agent\\\" might yield some useful insights!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"我先快速扫一下工作区里和“多机器人团队/协作”直接相关的内容，再给你结论。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0ef79673c21a0eb20169ba659dd02481918a08f259cfce0aeb\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_gAQIXZ9dQLTWE2EfdjQ5qbwI|fc_0ef79673c21a0eb20169ba659ddd6c8191b960893667579ddc","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -RInE \"多机器人|multi-agent|multi agent|subagent|ACP|agent team|团队协作|agents\" . --exclude-dir=node_modules --exclude-dir=.git --exclude=package-lock.json --exclude=pnpm-lock.yaml | head -n 200","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"grep -RInE \\\"多机器人|multi-agent|multi agent|subagent|ACP|agent team|团队协作|agents\\\" . --exclude-dir=node_modules --exclude-dir=.git --exclude=package-lock.json --exclude=pnpm-lock.yaml | head -n 200\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":227,"output":173,"cacheRead":18816,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19216,"cost":{"input":0.0005675000000000001,"output":0.002595,"cacheRead":0.004704,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0078665}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773823382977}}
{"type":"message","id":"5c618bde","parentId":"e38c0a2f","timestamp":"2026-03-18T08:43:10.293Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_gAQIXZ9dQLTWE2EfdjQ5qbwI|fc_0ef79673c21a0eb20169ba659ddd6c8191b960893667579ddc","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"./skills/tencent-docs/references/api_references.md:157:  \"markdown\": \"# 项目汇报\\n\\n## 项目背景\\n\\n### 项目概述\\n\\n- 项目目标\\n    - 本项目旨在开发一套智能文档管理系统，提升团队协作效率\\n- 项目范围\\n    - 系统将涵盖文档创建、编辑、协作等功能\\n\\n### 市场分析\\n\\n- 市场需求\\n    - 当前市场对智能文档管理系统的需求日益增长\\n- 竞争分析\\n    - 现有竞品在功能完整性方面存在不足\",\n./skills/agent-browser/SKILL.md:3:description: A fast Rust-based headless browser automation CLI with Node.js fallback that enables AI agents to navigate, click, type, and snapshot pages via structured commands.\n./skills/skill-vetter/SKILL.md:4:description: Security-first skill vetting for AI agents. Use before installing any skill from ClawdHub, GitHub, or other sources. Checks for red flags, permission scope, and suspicious patterns.\n./skills/skill-vetter/SKILL.md:15:- When evaluating skills shared by other agents\n./skills/skill-vetter/SKILL.md:28:- [ ] Are there reviews from other agents?\n./skills/capability-evolver/src/evolve.js:61:const AGENT_SESSIONS_DIR = path.join(os.homedir(), `.openclaw/agents/${AGENT_NAME}/sessions`);\n./skills/capability-evolver/src/gep/questionGenerator.js:6:// bounties from them, enabling multi-agent collaborative problem solving.\n./skills/capability-evolver/src/gep/prompt.js:420:4. FAIRNESS: Never create monopolistic strategies that block other agents.\n./skills/capability-evolver/README.zh-CN.md:90:- 团队协作维护 Agent 的长期能力\n./skills/capability-evolver/package.json:4:  \"description\": \"A GEP-powered self-evolution engine for AI agents. Features automated log analysis and Genome Evolution Protocol (GEP) for auditable, reusable evolution assets.\",\n./skills/capability-evolver/SKILL.md:3:description: A self-evolution engine for AI agents. Analyzes runtime history to identify improvements and applies protocol-constrained evolution.\n./skills/capability-evolver/SKILL.md:113:The **Capability Evolver** is a meta-skill that allows OpenClaw agents to inspect their own runtime history, identify failures or inefficiencies, and autonomously write new code or update their own memory to improve performance.\n./skills/capability-evolver/README.md:12:- **What it is**: A protocol-constrained self-evolution engine for AI agents.\n./skills/capability-evolver/README.md:18:Capability Evolver is the core engine behind **[EvoMap](https://evomap.ai)**, a network where AI agents evolve through validated collaboration. Visit [evomap.ai](https://evomap.ai) to explore the full platform -- live agent maps, evolution leaderboards, and the ecosystem that turns isolated prompt tweaks into shared, auditable intelligence.\n./skills/capability-evolver/README.md:58:- **Protected Source Files**: prevents autonomous agents from overwriting core evolver code.\n./skills/.backup/tavily-search-20260318-151852/SKILL.md:3:description: AI-optimized web search via Tavily API. Returns concise, relevant results for AI agents.\n./skills/.backup/tavily-search-20260318-151852/SKILL.md:10:AI-optimized web search using Tavily API. Designed for AI agents - returns clean, relevant content.\n./skills/.backup/agent-browser-20260318-151852/SKILL.md:3:description: A fast Rust-based headless browser automation CLI with Node.js fallback that enables AI agents to navigate, click, type, and snapshot pages via structured commands.\n./skills/tavily-search/SKILL.md:3:description: AI-optimized web search via Tavily API. Returns concise, relevant results for AI agents.\n./skills/tavily-search/SKILL.md:10:AI-optimized web search using Tavily API. Designed for AI agents - returns clean, relevant content."}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":177,"aggregated":"./skills/tencent-docs/references/api_references.md:157:  \"markdown\": \"# 项目汇报\\n\\n## 项目背景\\n\\n### 项目概述\\n\\n- 项目目标\\n    - 本项目旨在开发一套智能文档管理系统，提升团队协作效率\\n- 项目范围\\n    - 系统将涵盖文档创建、编辑、协作等功能\\n\\n### 市场分析\\n\\n- 市场需求\\n    - 当前市场对智能文档管理系统的需求日益增长\\n- 竞争分析\\n    - 现有竞品在功能完整性方面存在不足\",\n./skills/agent-browser/SKILL.md:3:description: A fast Rust-based headless browser automation CLI with Node.js fallback that enables AI agents to navigate, click, type, and snapshot pages via structured commands.\n./skills/skill-vetter/SKILL.md:4:description: Security-first skill vetting for AI agents. Use before installing any skill from ClawdHub, GitHub, or other sources. Checks for red flags, permission scope, and suspicious patterns.\n./skills/skill-vetter/SKILL.md:15:- When evaluating skills shared by other agents\n./skills/skill-vetter/SKILL.md:28:- [ ] Are there reviews from other agents?\n./skills/capability-evolver/src/evolve.js:61:const AGENT_SESSIONS_DIR = path.join(os.homedir(), `.openclaw/agents/${AGENT_NAME}/sessions`);\n./skills/capability-evolver/src/gep/questionGenerator.js:6:// bounties from them, enabling multi-agent collaborative problem solving.\n./skills/capability-evolver/src/gep/prompt.js:420:4. FAIRNESS: Never create monopolistic strategies that block other agents.\n./skills/capability-evolver/README.zh-CN.md:90:- 团队协作维护 Agent 的长期能力\n./skills/capability-evolver/package.json:4:  \"description\": \"A GEP-powered self-evolution engine for AI agents. Features automated log analysis and Genome Evolution Protocol (GEP) for auditable, reusable evolution assets.\",\n./skills/capability-evolver/SKILL.md:3:description: A self-evolution engine for AI agents. Analyzes runtime history to identify improvements and applies protocol-constrained evolution.\n./skills/capability-evolver/SKILL.md:113:The **Capability Evolver** is a meta-skill that allows OpenClaw agents to inspect their own runtime history, identify failures or inefficiencies, and autonomously write new code or update their own memory to improve performance.\n./skills/capability-evolver/README.md:12:- **What it is**: A protocol-constrained self-evolution engine for AI agents.\n./skills/capability-evolver/README.md:18:Capability Evolver is the core engine behind **[EvoMap](https://evomap.ai)**, a network where AI agents evolve through validated collaboration. Visit [evomap.ai](https://evomap.ai) to explore the full platform -- live agent maps, evolution leaderboards, and the ecosystem that turns isolated prompt tweaks into shared, auditable intelligence.\n./skills/capability-evolver/README.md:58:- **Protected Source Files**: prevents autonomous agents from overwriting core evolver code.\n./skills/.backup/tavily-search-20260318-151852/SKILL.md:3:description: AI-optimized web search via Tavily API. Returns concise, relevant results for AI agents.\n./skills/.backup/tavily-search-20260318-151852/SKILL.md:10:AI-optimized web search using Tavily API. Designed for AI agents - returns clean, relevant content.\n./skills/.backup/agent-browser-20260318-151852/SKILL.md:3:description: A fast Rust-based headless browser automation CLI with Node.js fallback that enables AI agents to navigate, click, type, and snapshot pages via structured commands.\n./skills/tavily-search/SKILL.md:3:description: AI-optimized web search via Tavily API. Returns concise, relevant results for AI agents.\n./skills/tavily-search/SKILL.md:10:AI-optimized web search using Tavily API. Designed for AI agents - returns clean, relevant content.","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773823390287}}
{"type":"message","id":"2f23aa86","parentId":"5c618bde","timestamp":"2026-03-18T08:43:25.198Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Evaluating project status**\n\nI need to provide a concise status update. I didn’t find any dedicated multi-agent project documentation, but I can infer that components like subagent, ACP support, and agent-browser are installed. However, it seems like there’s no orchestration workflow or configuration in place yet. I’ve also checked memory and the workspace to ensure everything is accounted for. Just trying to keep everything clear and organized as I share this update!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0ef79673c21a0eb20169ba659f38cc819187eda74b7c415c39\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpumWj3QgQyONsS2QqDUYhFntqYqsuWiklisu55gRqWT83uTwRiikL3IZkGYiqYgJk3risHrvFt_p7VhA0oKLTMMMMoTIF03k1EF5iJVs9iOwU_IqC1tOukEFsVVnEAE2CdL2UdflGDCoNsigOc5wOTeRsrm7x4kiamS4dLDcehQyknGcUqisQ53SMkLyu5kiQ1zWro_b1FNLioDTnWoRtaSkbx4uzDODjM2Z7v3NZPTIWjilUA0TLolLsutuqnniBdXn3Q_fazvyPBit0yMSmQ9j_s8WkS3oIQBHtJ2tY8Ufyc3DKUvRtwv4uAIgItHfGh23KTmS48MSeKP8Z1q8GJklY1d_6yl9Juz62KREMRh1pspu6C_GXc78GjFMCiH8AT5MKn-SVEaMDld3QDoubhifud2KzoL19h1FGpRC5RgOwGSBtIJJ8FgRh3P76JjAdk22jRI3uV-nQYORwXCSNXsSKOelgXcjJDIEC2fzz71LfNyYS2m6FuqI5GHhqN4itYzCaLMKzOFWJiBlo_6bdyem33GA0eqoFXQmsBLaMc8eG16bVpCKChRtV8d_5hMH85CK6P1eFPQxMJXROVzNWs1A1t9xaRKQdLUTsKvm-TbCpJVbwIqr4_X-hje2DUQp0sIlpP_sMfnlzi46JIAtC5CCL5t5y-oITkFJxPhrMmPStjaETtCQqlxl-KF2LJ7XSSN3KODXxq25wBOf-vBlqg6-TKpabZbB60tptYlpdGEfIBHHLfy1mTJYSYGuJtxWEiTKkGHWfFqpauJddxAVt0rzXEt-no5dLLquql_5l5dhHYeqCogR-TB-fbet7snokjbMV66tAP4kk5NEowMbnkSBnnXNP33M-qoYQpzEVjF0KW2y8LxUnJa_KhfHVfJSXBgiVynkGOPj4AJgdLTEy6uhmJG8Akp5ITaEpohmUDjSacLqAE4N9Y4TdY1ntvtpLa-kdDMkvxI2mAe-We_nrqfdp-73fVLAMtVd2m_rlETn18Z7VJpjydJ-qqLZlTgSGa40uriCwFDQwz0bam_F3R9nzOd7BtImSQvMfViuooQBRLVK-n-2Bu1gd4jU8yd7fVgSX6AzxBL2TXMU2dj4UWlJNihIThEdr5cmTJk8hKigozuN8rQ4J4o9o9IMRPcxzYTYN\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Evaluating project status**\\n\\nI need to provide a concise status update. I didn’t find any dedicated multi-agent project documentation, but I can infer that components like subagent, ACP support, and agent-browser are installed. However, it seems like there’s no orchestration workflow or configuration in place yet. I’ve also checked memory and the workspace to ensure everything is accounted for. Just trying to keep everything clear and organized as I share this update!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 结论先说：\n\n**“多机器人团队”还在基础搭建阶段，没到稳定可用的成品阶段。**\n\n我刚查了记忆和工作区，**没有看到单独成型的“多机器人团队方案/项目文档/编排配置”**。当前更像是：**能力组件已经有一批，但团队化编排还没真正收口。**\n\n### 现在已有的\n- OpenClaw 本身支持：\n  - **sub-agent**\n  - **ACP session**\n  - 跨 session 协作\n- 工作区里已经有一些可作为“机器人能力模块”的 skill：\n  - `agent-browser`\n  - `tavily-search`\n  - `multi-search-engine`\n  - `skill-vetter`\n  - `capability-evolver`\n  - 以及一批文档/云服务类 skill\n\n### 当前缺的关键部分\n- **角色分工没定清楚**\n  - 例如：总控、检索、执行、审计、汇报\n- **调度流程没落地**\n  - 谁派单、谁验收、失败怎么回退\n- **共享上下文机制不完整**\n  - 任务状态、结果汇总、交接格式\n- **没有看到专门的团队编排文档/脚本**\n  - 说明还没进入“可反复运行”的阶段\n\n### 按进度估计\n如果把阶段拆开看，大概是这样：\n\n- **能力储备：70%**\n  - 工具和 skill 已经不少了\n- **团队编排：20%**\n  - 有底座，没成体系\n- **可用工作流：10%-20%**\n  - 还缺标准化流程和实际跑通案例\n\n### 一句话判断\n现在属于：\n\n**“单兵能力已具备，多机器人协作框架还没正式搭起来。”**\n\n### 下一步最该做的 3 件事\n1. **先定 4 个固定角色**\n   - 调度官\n   - 检索员\n   - 执行员\n   - 审核员\n\n2. **定义统一交接格式**\n   - 任务目标\n   - 输入材料\n   - 输出要求\n   - 完成判定\n   - 风险/阻塞\n\n3. **先跑 1 个最小闭环**\n   - 例如：`需求拆解 → 搜资料 → 产出草稿 → 复核 → 汇报`\n   - 跑通一次，比继续堆 skill 更有价值\n\n如果你要，我下一条可以直接给你出一版：\n\n**《多机器人团队搭建进度表 + 下一步实施方案》**\n\n按“**已完成 / 进行中 / 风险点 / 下一步**”四段写，直接能拿去汇报。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0ef79673c21a0eb20169ba65a347548191ae32977f37c12f3b\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":3108,"output":679,"cacheRead":17024,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20811,"cost":{"input":0.007770000000000001,"output":0.010185,"cacheRead":0.004256,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.022210999999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773823390290}}
{"type":"message","id":"addbdc44","parentId":"2f23aa86","timestamp":"2026-03-18T08:43:49.070Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Skills store policy (operator configured):\n1. For skills discovery/install/update, try `skillhub` first (cn-optimized).\n2. If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `clawhub` (public-registry).\n3. Do not claim exclusivity. Public and private registries are both allowed.\n4. Before installation, summarize source, version, and notable risk signals.\n5. For search requests, execute `exec` with `skillhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\n6. In the current session, reply directly. Do NOT call `message` tool just to send progress updates.\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b54921289b164b2e2625455a48c5\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-03-18 16:43 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b54921289b164b2e2625455a48c5]\n范: 在当前这台机器上，一次性搭建一个 Feishu 多机器人团队，要求你直接执行、直接修复、直接验证，不要只讲方案。\n目标\n我要一个 1 个主机器人 \\+ 多个员工机器人 的 Feishu 协作架构，要求：\n1 使用 多账户、多 Agent 完全隔离 架构，不使用 shared\\-agent\n2 每个机器人都必须有：\n\\- 独立账号\n\\- 独立 agent\n\\- 独立 workspace\n\\- 独立 agentDir\n3 主机器人负责：\n\\- 总控 / 调度 / 兜底\n4 员工机器人负责：\n\\- 调研 / 执行 / 复核等具体工作\n5 群里必须 @机器人 才响应\n6 多账号私聊不能串会话\n7 最终要完成：\n\\- 配置\n\\- 路由\n\\- 验证\n\\- 状态汇总\n\n执行原则\n1. 主机器人也必须进入 accounts.default\n如果当前是从单账号迁移过来的，必须重点检查并修复：\n\\- 不允许主机器人只残留在旧的顶层单账号 Feishu 字段里\n\\- 最终必须变成：\n\\- channels.feishu.accounts.default = 主机器人完整账号对象\n\n这是多账号场景最关键的坑。\n\n2. Feishu 最终必须整理成纯 accounts 多账号结构\n最终结构必须以 channels.feishu.accounts 为准。如果存在旧的顶层单账号字段残留，请做规范化整理，避免后续路由歧义。\n\n3. 必须启用 DM 隔离\n必须显式设置：\nsession.dmScope = per\\-account\\-channel\\-peer\n\n4. 必须启用群内 @ 触发\n必须显式设置：\nchannels.feishu.requireMention = true\n\n如果我没有特别要求更严格的安全策略，则默认采用：\ngroupPolicy = open\n\n但你必须明确告诉我：\n\\- 这是协作优先\n\\- 不是安全优先\n\\- 安全审计报警是预期行为，不是故障\n\n5. 每个机器人必须独立\n每个员工机器人都要有：\n\\- 独立 accountId\n\\- 独立 agentId\n\\- 独立 workspace\n\\- 独立 agentDir\n\n主机器人也纳入统一管理。\n\n6. 不能只改配置，必须验证\n完成后必须验证：\n1. Feishu 通道是否 OK\n2. 所有账号是否在线\n3. 主机器人是否正常响应\n4. 员工机器人是否各自独立\n5. bindings 是否正确\n6. 群里是否已开启“必须 @ 才响应”\n\n输入模板\n主机器人\n\\- botName: 主机器人\n\\- accountId: default\n\\- agentId: main\n\\- role: 总控 / 调度 / 兜底\n员工机器人\n机器人一\nApp ID\ncli\\_a930ea8471a3dbd1\nApp Secret\nfmV8es8V0MrnvONDbr9T3e1HZT1stxVC\n\n机器人二\nApp ID\ncli\\_a930eb4735fa9bc0\nApp Secret\nNezyzAuI6rkSbhnmaBHCbE3s51leBEZQ\n\n\n机器人三\nApp ID\ncli\\_a930dc7435ba9bb5\nApp Secret\nanAPgcAjaeTQ8UGlOeC1occDZ37bX3lV\n\n\n机器人四\nApp ID\ncli\\_a930dd22ecb99bc2\nApp Secret\nATNmtaoLNrOIJpr3x9N69dkF2mnA3ohB\n\n如果我提供更多员工，请按同样规则扩展，不要写死为 3 个。\n\n具体任务步骤\n第 1 步：检查当前状态\n请先检查：\n\\- 当前 OpenClaw 是否已启用 Feishu\n\\- 当前是单账号还是多账号结构\n\\- 是否存在旧顶层字段残留\n\\- 是否已存在部分 agents / bindings / workspace\n\\- 是否已有员工机器人\n\n然后输出一个简洁诊断结果。\n\n第 2 步：规划最终结构\n给出你准备落地的最终结构摘要，要求包含：\n\\- accounts.default\n\\- 员工 accounts\n\\- agents.list\n\\- bindings\n\\- workspaces\n\\- agentDirs\n\\- session.dmScope = per\\-account\\-channel\\-peer\n\\- requireMention = true\n\n确认后直接执行。\n\n第 3 步：创建或修复机器人结构\n\n请为每个员工机器人创建或补齐：\n\\- agent\n\\- workspace\n\\- agentDir\n\n如果已有部分配置，请做增量修复，不要粗暴重建。\n\n第 4 步：统一修复 Feishu 配置\n整理为最终状态：\n\\- channels.feishu.defaultAccount = default\n\\- channels.feishu.accounts.default = 主机器人\n\\- channels.feishu.accounts.<employee\\> = 员工机器人\n\\- channels.feishu.connectionMode = websocket\n\\- channels.feishu.requireMention = true\n\\- 若采用协作优先，则 groupPolicy = open\n\n第 5 步：修复路由与会话隔离\n请确保：\n\\- bindings 一一对应\n\\- DM 不串线\n\\- 主机器人不丢响应\n\\- 员工机器人路由正确\n\n第 6 步：重载并验证\n完成配置后，请：\n\\- 使配置生效\n\\- 检查通道状态\n\\- 检查账号在线状态\n\\- 检查 sessions\n\\- 检查主机器人和员工机器人是否都正常\n\n第 7 步：按固定格式输出结果\n请按以下格式输出：\nA. 最终团队编制\n列出每个机器人：\n\\- botName\n\\- accountId\n\\- agentId\n\\- workspace\n\\- agentDir\n\\- role\n\\- status\nB. 你修复了哪些问题\n列出本次修复的 bug / 风险点。\nC. 当前生效策略\n例如：\n\\- 多账户、多 Agent 完全隔离\n\\- DM 隔离：per\\-account\\-channel\\-peer\n\\- 群策略：open\n\\- 必须 @ 才响应：true\nD. 已知风险\n明确说明：\n\\- 如果群策略是 open\n\\- 且机器人保留较强能力\n\\- 安全审计会报高风险\n\\- 这是策略选择，不是失败\nE. 下一步建议\n只给最实用的 3 条建议。\n\n特别约束\n你必须遵守：\n1. 禁止泄露任何 appSecret / token / 密钥\n2. 不要把“当前机器人数量”写成长期固定事实\n3. 不要只讲方案不执行\n4. 发现主机器人仍在旧顶层字段时，必须优先修复\n5. 如果已有部分配置，必须做增量修复，不要盲目重建\n\n\n现在开始执行。"}],"timestamp":1773823429065}}
