{"type":"message","id":"e23b5e6e","parentId":"b5474241","timestamp":"2026-03-18T08:47:22.099Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Skills store policy (operator configured):\n1. For skills discovery/install/update, try `skillhub` first (cn-optimized).\n2. If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `clawhub` (public-registry).\n3. Do not claim exclusivity. Public and private registries are both allowed.\n4. Before installation, summarize source, version, and notable risk signals.\n5. For search requests, execute `exec` with `skillhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\n6. In the current session, reply directly. Do NOT call `message` tool just to send progress updates.\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5492275cbcdcb4bc022d8c84717\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-03-18 16:47 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b5492275cbcdcb4bc022d8c84717]\n范: 阅读 https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIxNjczNjE2Mg==&tempkey=MTM2Nl9JVGhNakU5SjIwN1VORVkzT05HTjZIbUJnaWFULWxWeElvQW90WVpMVmFpcGlia0hYdGVLUERTeFNvX3pXTERBWTV3Q3B5VzBFWk1ZLUxVUFdXLWxfSDNWc1cwUkFXSktXczI4d09XWlVHbHRUUXdha1ViU3N2akJjeVctcU4wc0tmOElkRmRzSVF3SWp5OXY4Z0xDSjFSc0hCOTIxd1ZmQ1Frd3RBfn4%3D&chksm=1786351d20f1bc0b406dc55ae2427611292b23e6d37b202e82605bae6316c5680ddaea037374#rd\n使用里面的方法进行搭建，然后通知我进度"}],"timestamp":1773823642083}}
