e files:\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/concepts/memory.md:33:这些文件位于工作空间下（`agents.defaults.workspace`，默认 `~/.openclaw/workspace`）。完整布局参见[智能体工作空间](/concepts/agent-workspace)。\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/concepts/memory.md:73:- **工作空间必须可写**：如果会话以 `workspaceAccess: \"ro\"` 或 `\"none\"` 在沙箱中运行，则跳过刷新。\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/concepts/session.md:19:使用 `session.dmScope` 控制**私信**如何分组：\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/concepts/session.md:24:- `per-account-channel-peer`：按账户 + 渠道 + 发送者隔离（推荐用于多账户收件箱）。\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/concepts/session.md:25:  使用 `session.identityLinks` 将带提供商前缀的对等 ID 映射到规范身份，这样在使用 `per-peer`、`per-channel-peer` 或 `per-account-channel-peer` 时，同一个人可以跨渠道共享私信会话。\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/concepts/session.md:55:- 直接聊天遵循 `session.dmScope`（默认 `main`）。\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/concepts/session.md:60:  - `per-account-channel-peer`：`agent:<agentId>:<channel>:<accountId>:dm:<peerId>`（accountId 默认为 `default`）。\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@type