-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/concepts/agent.md:64:- 工作区：`<workspace>/skills`\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/concepts/agent.md:73:- 不读取 `~/.pi/agent` 或 `<workspace>/.pi` 设置。\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/concepts/agent.md:110:- `agents.defaults.workspace`\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/concepts/context.md:47:Workspace: <workspaceDir>\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/concepts/context.md:52:Injected workspace files:\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/concepts/memory.md:33:这些文件位于工作空间下（`agents.defaults.workspace`，默认 `~/.openclaw/workspace`）。完整布局参见[智能体工作空间](/concepts/agent-workspace)。\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/concepts/memory.md:73:- **工作空间必须可写**：如果会话以 `workspaceAccess: \"ro\"` 或 `\"none\"` 在沙箱中运行，则跳过刷新。\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/concepts/session.md:19:使用 `session.dmScope` 控制**私信**如何分组：\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/do