aw/workspace`\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/concepts/agent-workspace.md:30:  `~/.openclaw/workspace-<profile>`。\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/concepts/agent-workspace.md:36:    workspace: \"~/.openclaw/workspace\",\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/concepts/agent-workspace.md:54:如果你有意保留多个工作区，请确保 `agents.defaults.workspace` 指向活动的那个。\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/concepts/agent-workspace.md:138:cd ~/.openclaw/workspace\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/concepts/agent-workspace.md:141:git commit -m \"Add agent workspace\"\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/concepts/agent-workspace.md:163:gh repo create openclaw-workspace --private --source . --remote origin --push\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/concepts/agent-workspace.md:210:1. 将仓库克隆到所需路径（默认 `~/.openclaw/workspace`）。\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/concepts/agent-workspace.md:211:2. 在 `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json` 中将 `agents.defaults.workspace` 