Q==\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 进度汇报：\n\n**结论：这台机器上的 Feishu 多机器人团队已经搭起来了，当前不是“从 0 开始搭”，而是“已存在 + 我做了核查和修补”。**\n\n### 1) 我刚核查到的现状\n已经满足你要的核心结构：\n\n- **1 个主机器人 + 4 个员工机器人**\n- **多账户、多 Agent 完全隔离**\n- 每个机器人都有：\n  - 独立 `accountId`\n  - 独立 `agentId`\n  - 独立 `workspace`\n  - 独立 `agentDir`\n- 路由已经是一一绑定，不是 shared-agent\n- 主机器人已经在：\n  - `channels.feishu.accounts.default`\n- Feishu 当前是：\n  - `defaultAccount = default`\n  - `connectionMode = websocket`\n  - `requireMention = true`\n- DM 隔离已经是：\n  - `session.dmScope = per-account-channel-peer`\n\n### 2) 我已经执行的修复\n我刚直接做了 1 个明确修复：\n\n- **修复了 OpenClaw 配置文件权限**\n  - `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json`\n  - 从 **644 改成 600**\n  - 避免配置文件世界可读\n\n这个是实际改动，不是只讲方案。\n\n### 3) 我已经完成的验证\n我已经直接跑了状态检查，结果如下：\n\n- **OpenClaw 网关**\n  - 运行正常\n- **Feishu 通道**\n  - `OK`\n- **Feishu 账号**\n  - `accounts 5/5`\n- **健康探测**\n  - `default / execution / qa / research / review = ok`\n- **bindings**\n  - 已验证为一一对应：\n    - `default -> main`\n    - `research -> research`\n    - `execution -> execution`\n    - `review -> review`\n    - `qa -> qa`\n- **workspace / agentDir**\n  - 5 组目录全部存在，未缺失\n\n### 4) 当前团队编制\n- **主机器人**\n  - `accountId: default`\n  - `agentId: main`\n  - `workspace: /root/.openclaw/workspace`\n  - `agentDir: /root/.openclaw/agents/main/agent`\n  - 角色：总控 / 调度 / 兜底\n\n- **调研机器人**\n  - `accountId: research`\n  - `agentId: research`\n  - `workspace: /root/.openclaw/workspaces/research`\n  - `agentDir: /root/.openclaw/agents/research/agent`\n\n- **执行机器人**\n  - `accountId: execution`\n  - `agentId: execution`\n  - `workspace: /root/.openclaw/workspaces/execution`\n  - `agentDir: /root/.openclaw/agents/execution/agent`\n\n- **复核机器人**\n  - `accountId: review`\n  - `agentId: review`\n  - `workspace: /root/.openclaw/workspaces/review`\n  - `agentDir: /root/.openclaw/agents/review/agent`\n\n- **质检机器人**\n  - `accountId: qa`\n  - `agentId: qa`\n  - `workspace: /root/.openclaw/workspaces/qa`\n  - `agentDir: /root/.openclaw/agents/qa/agent`\n\n### 5) 当前还在继续确认的点\n有一个点我明确提醒你：\n\n- 现在群策略是 **`groupPolicy = open`**\n- 同时启用了 **`requireMention = true`**\n\n这代表：\n\n- **协作优先**\n- **不是安全优先**\n- 安全审计报 **高风险** 是**预期行为，不是故障**\n\n也就是：系统工作正常，但策略偏开放。\n\n### 6) 关于你发的公众号文章\n那个微信链接我直接抓正文时，只拿到了**临时预览壳**，正文没完整吐出来。\n所以我没有停在“等文章可读”这一步，而是已经按**本机现有配置 + OpenClaw 官方多 Agent / 多账号机制**先落地核验和修复了。\n\n---\n\n### 当前进度判断\n**进度：85%**\n还差的不是基础搭建，而是你要不要我继续做下面两件事：\n\n1. **输出最终完整验收清单**\n   - 按你要求的 A/B/C/D/E 固定格式\n2. **补做实战验证**\n   - 我给你一套最短 Feishu 测试动作\n   - 用于验证“群里必须 @ 才响应”和“多账号私聊不串线”\n\n你回我一句：\n\n- **“继续验收”**\n或\n- **“直接做最终报告”**\n\n我就接着干。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0ef79673c21a0eb20169ba67573e848191a4b55315d14cb91e\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":2842,"output":1214,"cacheRead":59136,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":63192,"cost":{"input":0.007105,"output":0.01821,"cacheRead":0.014783999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.040098999999999996}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773823818369}}
{"type":"message","id":"dc6406c8","parentId":"f744dd0a","timestamp":"2026-03-18T09:02:33.603Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Skills store policy (operator configured):\n1. For skills discovery/install/update, try `skillhub` first (cn-optimized).\n2. If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `clawhub` (public-registry).\n3. Do not claim exclusivity. Public and private registries are both allowed.\n4. Before installation, summarize source, version, and notable risk signals.\n5. For search requests, execute `exec` with `skillhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\n6. In the current session, reply directly. Do NOT call `message` tool just to send progress updates.\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5492ec4bf4b8c36f38d1990a77b\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-03-18 17:02 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b5492ec4bf4b8c36f38d1990a77b]\n范: 继续验收"}],"timestamp":1773824553595}}
